    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58694" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοσυρτός</span></b> , ὁ, poet.
		word, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>noisy rabble</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν ἠδὲ κυνῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.147
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				13.472
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν Ἀθηναίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					666
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παιδαρίων καὶ γραϊδίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					536
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>tumult, uproar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				880
			</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοσυρτέω</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θορυβῶ</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
